  "interpretation": "<ul data-start=\"1399\" data-end=\"1883\">\n<li data-start=\"1399\" data-end=\"1649\">\n<p data-start=\"1401\" data-end=\"1421\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"1401\" data-end=\"1419\">MUC4 Positive:</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1424\" data-end=\"1649\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1424\" data-end=\"1542\">\n<p data-start=\"1426\" data-end=\"1542\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Often expressed in <strong data-start=\"1445\" data-end=\"1500\">pancreatic, breast, lung, salivary gland carcinomas</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"1506\" data-end=\"1539\">low-grade fibromyxoid sarcoma</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1545\" data-end=\"1649\">\n<p data-start=\"1547\" data-end=\"1649\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">May indicate <strong data-start=\"1560\" data-end=\"1590\">epithelial differentiation</strong> or be used as a <strong data-start=\"1607\" data-end=\"1628\">prognostic marker</strong> in specific cancers.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1651\" data-end=\"1762\">\n<p data-start=\"1653\" data-end=\"1673\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"1653\" data-end=\"1671\">MUC4 Negative:</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1676\" data-end=\"1762\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1676\" data-end=\"1762\">\n<p data-start=\"1678\" data-end=\"1762\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Helps <strong data-start=\"1684\" data-end=\"1722\">rule out certain epithelial tumors</strong> and narrow down differential diagnoses.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1764\" data-end=\"1883\">\n<p data-start=\"1766\" data-end=\"1793\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"1766\" data-end=\"1791\">Clinical Correlation:</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1796\" data-end=\"1883\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1796\" data-end=\"1883\">\n<p data-start=\"1798\" data-end=\"1883\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Must be interpreted with <strong data-start=\"1823\" data-end=\"1882\">H&amp;E morphology, other IHC markers, and clinical context</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
